<title>SINGAPORE: GB 1997 net losses deepen.</title>
<headline>GB 1997 net losses deepen.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31 997</p>
<p>(in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net losses		    1.68   vs   0.98</p>
<p>    Group share (cents)(loss) 2.23   vs   1.30 (loss)</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)	    0.15   vs   0.20</p>
<p>    Turnover		     42.88   vs  46.46</p>
<p>    Operating profit	    1.65   vs   1.71</p>
<p>    Interest expense	    0.42   vs   0.36</p>
<p>    Depreciation		  2.93   vs   2.56</p>
<p>    Pretax loss		   1.70   vs   1.24</p>
<p>    Associates		    0.07   vs   0.10</p>
<p>Note - Power boat maker GB Holdings Ltd said its results were affected by higher depreciation charges and lower sales in its major markets. It said it expects operating results to be similar this year.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
